{
  "2166178902": "<IthkuilWord word=\"osaka\" />",
  "3967414753": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-wubwoixa ženév\" />",
  "bf422b36c5": "Appendix A: Demonyms, Ethnonyms, and Place Names",
  "a4d5501635": "Toponyms, demonyms and other proper names are a phonetic rendering of the native name, to the extent Ithkuil’s phoneme inventory allows. Ithkuil phonotactic restraints do not apply as long as the name is pronounceable. The two new affixes below are available for use as appropriate.",
  "11446ddde3": "Names of Continents",
  "02d110dd77": "These are preceded by the carrier stem form <IthkuilWord word=\"usarç\" /> or <IthkuilWord word=\"usarça\" />:",
  "eeb87a9138": "<IthkuilWord word=\"usarça\" /> áfrika",
  "f5cd262901": "Africa",
  "099bd5294a": "<IthkuilWord word=\"usarça\" /> antárktika",
  "44b439ba99": "Antarctica",
  "93725bc3c6": "<IthkuilWord word=\"usarça\" /> asya",
  "154a67340e": "Asia",
  "c838507dda": "<IthkuilWord word=\"usarça\" /> europa",
  "912d59cdf1": "Europe",
  "8b0238ddb3": "<IthkuilWord word=\"usarça\" /> oseanya",
  "2d88361908": "Oceania",
  "8f1306a218": "<IthkuilWord word=\"usarçaidna\" /> amérika",
  "5ffec2d87a": "North America",
  "2b6a7e74c3": "<IthkuilWord word=\"usarçuidna\" /> amérika",
  "aab422acb3": "South America",
  "e18b8174d2": "Names of Oceans",
  "ab6046ffd2": "These are preceded by the word <IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-bwala\" /> [Carrier Stem 3 concatenated with Stem 1 of <Root id=\"bw\" /> ‘ocean’] meaning ‘ocean named...’. The Southern Ocean (a.k.a. Antarctic) does not use the carrier stem, instead simply utilizing the Type-2 <Affix id=\"ocg\" degree=\"9\" type=\"2\" /> ‘southern’ with stem 1 of <Root id=\"bw\" /> ‘ocean’. As an alternative to <del>incorporating</del> <ins>concatenating</ins> the carrier stem, a carrier adjunct with <Term code=\"ess\" /> case <IthkuilWord word=\"hleʼi\" /> may be used or the <Term code=\"spf\" /> register adjunct <IthkuilWord word=\"hi\" />.",
  "2b236bd0ab": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-bwala pasífika\" /><br>\n      OR<br>\n      <IthkuilWord word=\"bwala hi pasífika\" />",
  "3e3b0e4c1d": "Pacific Ocean",
  "273d9f3b84": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-bwala atlantis\" /><br>\n      OR<br>\n      <IthkuilWord word=\"bwala hi atlantis\" />",
  "04f7e6cf52": "Atlantic Ocean",
  "7600bf3207": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-bwala indus\" /><br>\n      OR<br>\n      <IthkuilWord word=\"bwala hi indus\" />",
  "fe6fc88221": "Indian Ocean",
  "e7f360f02b": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-bwala arktos\" /><br>\n      OR<br>\n      <IthkuilWord word=\"bwala hi arktos\" />",
  "c57f1dd7e8": "Arctic Ocean",
  "1cf347a8af": "<IthkuilWord word=\"bwaluidna\" />",
  "e895d19505": "Southern/Antarctic Ocean",
  "7b94bb8a15": "Names of Seas and Lakes",
  "976e40e34a": "These are preceded by the word *hluséi-bwaleuxa* (‘smaller ocean named...’) if referring to a large mostly landlocked salt-water sea (e.g., Mediterranean, Black, Azov), or *hlusé-bwalafta* (‘section of an ocean named...’ utilizing the <Affix id=\"por\" /> affix -**ft**-) if referring to a section or sub-section of a larger sea or ocean (e.g., Baltic, South China, North).",
  "ba64bcac2a": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-bwaloufta mediterra\" />",
  "980a86dfd4": "Mediterranean Sea",
  "fc277c605e": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-bwalëufta balt\" />",
  "3013a70212": "Baltic Sea",
  "e84f553cf4": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hraxmé-bwaleufta\" />",
  "d9adbf74d3": "Black Sea",
  "a793d5e8f2": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-bwaleifta azof\" />",
  "e81d4caeae": "Sea of Azov",
  "3c83fd0574": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-bwalëufta karíb\" />",
  "5277dd1a15": "Caribbean Sea",
  "69707a9baa": "<IthkuilWord word=\"bwalaidneufta\" />",
  "d22ce75aa4": "North Sea",
  "3ff89fd4b8": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-bwalëufta bering\" />",
  "37aa5e1461": "Bering Sea",
  "cb5c82407f": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-bwalëufta arab\" />",
  "9e04dcb13e": "Arabian Sea",
  "817505c22b": "Those examples above utilizing an <del>incorporated</del> <ins>concatenated</ins> carrier stem may alternately be expressed using the carrier adjunct *hle’i* or the <Term code=\"spf\" /> register adjunct *hi*, i.e., *bwaloufta hi mediterra*, *bwalëufta hi balt*, *bwaleifta hi azof*, *bwalëufta hi karíb*, etc.",
  "9aad77d11e": "Large saltwater lakes not connected to the world ocean (e.g., Caspian Sea, Aral Sea) use Stem 3 of -**BW**- ‘saltwater lake’ rather than Stem 1 in conjunction with the appropriate <Affix id=\"siz\" /> affix -**x**-. Freshwater lakes use Stem 1 of -**LZ**- while freshwater inland seas use Stem 3 of -**LZ**-.",
  "564ff32003": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-wubwiuxa kaspi\" />",
  "af033a7a93": "Caspian Sea",
  "3e03180895": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-wubwoixäkta aral\" />",
  "4fbb9886eb": "Aral Sea",
  "9743717246": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-wubwoixa baikál\" />",
  "635d5e7f2c": "Lake Baikal",
  "8aa6959b36": "Lake Geneva",
  "791f1e1806": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-walziuxa érìe\" />",
  "d0c44532ce": "Lake Erie",
  "8024f52c9c": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-wulza kínneret\" />",
  "09460c28c1": "Sea of Galilee",
  "c688298b9c": "Progressively smaller sub-sections of oceans such as gulfs, bays, bights, and sounds attach various degrees of the <Affix id=\"por\" /> affix to *hlusé-bwala* or *bwala hle’i / hi*.",
  "77f028b606": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hluséi-bwaleufta biskaya\" />",
