  "59e494d432": "Names of Terrestrial Landmarks",
  "c8a9d3c42a": "The roots -**JL**- ‘MOUNTAINOUS TOPOGRAPHY’, -**ZH**- ‘DESERT/STEPPE/TUNDRA’, -**VŇ**- ‘VALLEY/CANYON/ GORGE’ and -**LZW**- ‘ESTUARY / RIVER DELTA’ are likewise used with the carrier stem or carrier adjunct.",
