  "7f3da4b5d9": "<IthkuilWord word=\"hlellú-allkila (hi britanya hiu wusadnuň eryë)\" />",
  "c30ae2a1ca": "United Kingdom (of Great Britain and North Ireland)",
  "ce6d3488dd": "The ten specialized names listed immediately above utilize stems from the following four roots:",
